WEBVTT

00:00:00.461 --> 00:00:01.154
Every day,

00:00:01.164 --> 00:00:03.365
restaurants and suppliers run on calls,

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:04.779
chats and paper.

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:06.180
Orders get lost.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:07.576
Stock is a guess.

00:00:07.861 --> 00:00:09.985
Nobody knows where the delivery is.

00:00:10.661 --> 00:00:13.212
Supplify puts every order on one line.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:15.018
From the first tap,

00:00:15.028 --> 00:00:16.616
to the final invoice.

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:22.276
A restaurant finds its suppliers,

00:00:22.286 --> 00:00:23.098
builds an order,

00:00:23.108 --> 00:00:24.189
and sends it.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.737
Then it follows every step,

00:00:26.747 --> 00:00:28.111
all the way to the door.

00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:30.957
It confirms what arrived.

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:31.599
Next week,

00:00:31.609 --> 00:00:33.474
reordering takes a few taps.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.433
The supplier sees it the moment it lands.

00:00:37.443 --> 00:00:39.565
Accepts it. Checks stock.

00:00:40.341 --> 00:00:42.379
A driver takes it from the warehouse,

00:00:42.389 --> 00:00:44.636
and every status update follows.

00:00:45.301 --> 00:00:46.917
And you can see who is ordering,

00:00:46.927 --> 00:00:48.070
and who is due.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.139
Your colours. Your logo. Same line.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:55.212
Supplify. Every order, one line.

00:00:55.642 --> 00:00:57.515
Request a personal demo.
